<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Spot saved. Your $1,610 rebate is waiting</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>You've locked in your place. There's nothing more you need to do right now.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="hi">Smart move, Helen. Your spot is saved.</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading" padding="4px 12px 10px">Your $1,610 rebate is waiting</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Thousands of Victorians have registered. Spots are released in the order they were saved. You've locked in your place, so there's nothing more you need to do right now.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-mint">
          <mj-text mj-class="eyebrow center" padding="18px 12px 6px">VEU rebate</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="big-green" padding="0 12px 18px">You save $1,610</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel">
          <mj-text mj-class="eyebrow center" padding="18px 12px 6px">You pay about</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="big-blue">$2,188</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="small center" padding="0 16px 18px">Estimate incl. GST for 137 m². You'll see your exact price before you agree to anything.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">What happens next</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 4px">
            <tr><td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:1px 0 14px;"><span class="num">1</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Your place is kept</strong><br /><span class="muted">Saving your spot is free, with no obligation.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:1px 0 12px;"><span class="num">2</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>We'll be in touch</strong><br /><span class="muted">When your spot is released, we'll tell you your next step.</span></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" padding="0 18px 16px">See my job</mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">What's included in $2,188</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 6px">
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Licensed electrician safety check</strong><br /><span class="muted">Done before any insulation goes in, to make sure wiring, downlights and cables are safe.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Premium R5.0 ceiling batts</strong><br /><span class="muted">VEU-approved and made to Australian Standard AS/NZS 4859.1.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Fitted by an EEC-certified installer</strong><br /><span class="muted">A Certified Insulation Installer, working to Australian Standard AS 3999.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>We handle the rebate</strong><br /><span class="muted">As a VEU Accredited Person (A003654), we do the paperwork. The $1,610 comes straight off your price.</span></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">Not included – only if needed</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 6px">
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="plus">+</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>Removing old insulation</strong>, if any needs to come out</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="plus">+</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>Ceiling access fee</strong>, if your ceiling is hard to get into</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="plus">+</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>Electrical fixes</strong>, if the safety check finds any</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="plus">+</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>A bigger ceiling</strong> than you told us</td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="14px 12px 0">You'll know the exact price before you agree to anything.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 2px">Have a friend who needs a spot saved?</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 6px">Send them our free eligibility checker. It takes a minute.</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 16px"><a href="https://homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/homeowner?ref=TEST" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;">Send to a friend &rarr;</a></mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-owner.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
